      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KEPIL (3) was below best at his last start when 7th at this track following a second place finish (17.73) there two back. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Looks the one to beat on his best form. ROSE LINKIN (4) was well fancied last time and led throughout to score (19.49) at Bulli in a Maiden over 340m. Should be in this for a long way. BAD GIRL RIVER (7) was out of placings last time (20.66) at Gunnedah in a Grade 5, finishing eighth and beaten 11 lengths. Has already won out of this draw. Makes strong appeal on best. KEAON BANNER (1) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
